This project reimplements the behaviour of CMake 4.1.0, and parts of it are
derived from CMake:

- Files under tests/ whose names start with "upstream_", and any file whose
  header says "Verbatim from Kitware CMake", are copied from the CMake 4.1.0
  test suite.
- Source comments that say "Port of <cmSomething>" mark code whose logic was
  translated from the named CMake source file.
- Some help text, diagnostics and data tables reproduce CMake's own text so
  that the output matches byte for byte.

